*> DL/I calls checked against the PSB the program schedules: ORDREAD
*> reads ORDER and ORDLINE (PROCOPT=G).
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. ORDUPD.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  PSB-NAME           PIC X(8) VALUE "ORDREAD".
01  ORDER-AREA         PIC X(120).
01  LINE-AREA          PIC X(60).
01  NOTE-AREA          PIC X(200).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    EXEC DLI SCHD PSB((PSB-NAME)) END-EXEC
    EXEC DLI GU USING PCB(1) SEGMENT(ORDER) INTO(ORDER-AREA) END-EXEC
    EXEC DLI GNP USING PCB(1) SEGMENT(ORDLINE) INTO(LINE-AREA) END-EXEC
    EXEC DLI REPL USING PCB(1) SEGMENT(ORDER) FROM(ORDER-AREA) END-EXEC
    EXEC DLI GNP USING PCB(1) SEGMENT(ORDNOTE) INTO(NOTE-AREA) END-EXEC
    EXEC DLI TERM END-EXEC
    GOBACK.
